<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
</head><body class="bg-white text-neutral-900">
<main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 font-sans antialiased">
<header class="mb-8">
<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">今田 慎一郎</h1>
<p class="text-base mt-2">DX 支援</p></header>
<section><h2 class="font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Links</h2>
<ul class="space-y-1"><li class=""><a href="https://example.com/" class="hover:underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Blog</a></li></ul></section>
